ssues/events/1044193466","actor":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-04-15T20:23:43Z","milestone":{"title":"0.3"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":1044193496,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDEwNDQxOTM0OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/1044193496","actor":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-04-15T20:23:52Z","label":{"name":"bug-crash","color":"f9d0c4"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/337575545","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/6509#issuecomment-337575545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/6509","id":337575545,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMzNzU3NTU0NQ==","user":{"login":"Snaipe","id":977973,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3Nzk3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/977973?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe","html_url":"https://github.com/Snaipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-10-18T12:34:01Z","updated_at":"2017-10-18T12:34:01Z","body":"I got bitten a few times by this. It seems to only happen in high-disk-latency environments for me.\r\n\r\nIt seems that for some reason check_abbr gets called with the columns provided from an Insstart cursor that has a column set to MAXCOL.\r\n\r\nNow, Insstart gets populated from curwin->w_cursor, and a quick search through the sources indicate that col may be set to that value in a bunch of different situations.\r\n\r\nA quick and dirty fix I made to avoid hanging altogether was to check for MAXCOL in check_abbr. It's probably not the \"right\" fix as having a MAXCOL column seems nonsensical when we reach check_abbr, but at least I don't have to sigkill my editor.\r\n\r\n```patch\r\ndiff --git a/src/nvim/edit.c b/src/nvim/edit.c\r\nindex 2bafb77..9f38c76 100644\r\n--- a/src/nvim/edit.c\r\n+++ b/src/nvim/edit.c\r\n@@ -6419,14 +6419,19 @@ char_u *get_last_insert_save(void)\r\n static bool echeck_abbr(int c)\r\n   FUNC_ATTR_PURE FUNC_ATTR_WARN_UNUSED_RESULT\r\n {\r\n+  int mincol;\r\n+\r\n   // Don't check for abbreviation in paste mode, when disabled and just\r\n   // after moving around with cursor keys.\r\n   if (p_paste || no_abbr || arrow_used) {\r\n     return false;\r\n   }\r\n \r\n-  return check_abbr(c, get_cursor_line_ptr(), curwin->w_cursor.col,\r\n-      curwin->w_cursor.lnum == Insstart.lnum ? Insstart.col : 0);\r\n+  mincol = curwin->w_cursor.lnum == Insstart.lnum ? Insstart.col : 0;\r\n+  if (mincol == MAXCOL)\r\n+      return false;\r\n+\r\n+  return check_abbr(c, get_cursor_line_ptr(), curwin->w_cursor.col, mincol);\r\n }\r\n \r\n /*\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/337575545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Snaipe","id":977973,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3Nzk3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/977973?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe","html_url":"https://github.com/Snaipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Snaipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.c